How to run

Open a normal terminal in the repo folder, then:

1. See the rules


powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File "copilot_helper_tools\approval-auto.ps1" -ShowTargets
2. Check it sees your buttons — open a real prompt first


powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File "copilot_helper_tools\approval-auto.ps1" -List
Look for green <-- WOULD CLICK lines.
3. Dry run — finds but never clicks


powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File "copilot_helper_tools\approval-auto.ps1" -DryRun
4. Run for real


powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File "copilot_helper_tools\approval-auto.ps1"
Ctrl+C to stop.
Useful flags

-IncludeAmbiguous — also bare Run, Accept, Continue.
-LogFile clicks.log — keep a record of every click.
-IntervalMs 500 — react faster.
-MaxClicks 1 — click once, then quit.
